# BuildKit uses <dockerfile>.dockerignore (this file) IN PREFERENCE to the context-root
# .dockerignore when building `-f mayhem/Dockerfile`. Upstream's root .dockerignore starts
# with `.*` (dropping .git), so we override it here to bake in the FULL repo — including
# .git history (grader / PATCH tier need it, SPEC §6.2 item 2) — dropping only local
# build artifacts and editor cruft.

**/target/
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
**/__pycache__/

.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
